{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T11:15:59.524Z","author":"pm-github","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"4400fc26dce6d999aa811cc5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Hosted evidence\n\nTwo actual runs reach and pass both `Preview GitHub to pm plan` and `Gated GitHub to pm import`, then fail `Verify repeat import is a no-op` without publishing a branch:\n\n- [PM Web run 45792469885 / job 139814702911](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/actions/runs/45792469885/job/139814702911), caller `12a277c0d4cb069af0c5b3ada73f08d02138f782`, installed pm-github `2026.11.25`. The repeat reports a changed `updated_at` on `pm-web-5sx6`. Consumer alert: [pm-web#369](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/issues/369).\n- [PM RL run 45799801908 / job 139839761659](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/45799801908/job/139839761659), caller `273a68769d1ab37b1bbc89a71b4fba1a8f9613d6`. After the separate provenance issue was fixed by [pm-rl#211](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/211), the repeat reports a changed `updated_at` on `pm-rl-github-eecd7460423f-202`. Consumer alert: [pm-rl#210](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/issues/210).\n\nThese are the same observed failure class, not proof of a single underlying cause. The logs do not show whether the provider records changed between the two imports, nor prove this is the same cause as the closed 2026.10.19 history-churn report #175. This is distinct from the host-compatibility, timestamp validation, and reserved-ID preview refusals.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nFor a pinned unchanged source snapshot, the initial write and identical repeat must preserve the item timestamp, authoritative history and permitted changes on the repeat. If source inputs actually change between passes, return a clear source-drift diagnostic without publishing; retain the fail-closed privacy and no-op gates. Include a sanitized regression exercising both stable and changed evidence and verify the matching hosted workflow on at least one affected consumer."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-github-github-ee4d59c27b67-287"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Gated sync on 2026.11.25 stops at the repeat no-op check after item updated_at changes"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH issue #287: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/issues/287 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-26T10:29:01Z · updated 2026-11-26T13:28:22Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["gh:unbraind/pm-github#287","github_author:unbraind"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-27T11:15:59.524Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T11:15:59.524Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pm-github"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"9f717e13bb242bb40c6daf8c3ca5c031c10c8e297b6314ee8f7a71440260c173","item_hash_version":3,"message":"Imported from GitHub #287","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"39a7e744828e7dede8d5d4bc9654b8eda360227b7b69f6eea0d721144161cd33"}
